- Asks before unsaved changes are left — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories.create#Requirements[NEWLEAVE])

### Actions

- Save — [exposes](aim:juicebar.categories.create#Operation:CreateCategory)

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/categories/wizard/category-wizard.component.ts#CategoryWizardComponent` — as: component
- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/categories/category-fields/category-fields.component.ts#CategoryFieldsComponent` — as: component
