## View: AddSubcategory

### Summary

A dialog that adds a subcategory under the category it was opened from.

### Display

- Name (required), description, the order (the parent's last place, not editable), the active switch and, where `showPublic` is set, the public switch — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories.create#Requirements[NEWDEFAULTS]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories#Requirements[CATACTIVE])
- A click outside the dialog does not close it — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories.create#Requirements[NEWDIALOG])

### Actions

- Add — [exposes](aim:juicebar.categories.create#Operation:CreateCategory)
- Cancel — [navigates](aim:juicebar.categories.tree#View:CategoryTree)

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/categories/child-category-dialog/child-category-dialog.component.ts#ChildCategoryDialogComponent` — as: component
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: CreateCategory

### Summary

A staff member creates a category in the admin's language: a first-level category, or a subcategory of a given parent.

### Input

```schema
name: string required
description: string
order: integer
active: boolean
public: boolean
parent_id: string ref(juicebar.categories#Category.id)
language: string required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.categories#Persona:CategoryEditor`
- `juicebar.categories#Persona:CategorySuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- A category exists with the name and description in the given language, the order (or none when it is not a number), the active switch and the parent — [mutates](aim:juicebar.categories#Record:Category), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories#Requirements[CATNAME]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories#Requirements[CATORDER]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories.create#Requirements[NEWEMPTY]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar#Requirements[LANG])
- It has a unique slug made from the name in that language — [mutates](aim:juicebar.categories#Record:Category), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories#Requirements[CATSLUG])
- It belongs to the staff member's organisation — [mutates](aim:juicebar.categories#Record:Category), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories#Requirements[CATORG])
- Where `showPublic` is set, it is public as given — [mutates](aim:juicebar.categories#Record:Category), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories#Requirements[CATPUBLIC]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar#Requirements[CONFIG])
- A notice tells whether it worked — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories.create#Requirements[NEWDONE])
- The operation is refused without the `create` permission — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.categories#Requirements[CATROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar#Requirements[ROLES])

### Returns

- The new category's id.

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/categories/wizard/category-wizard.component.ts#CategoryWizardComponent.create` — as: component
- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/categories/child-category-dialog/child-category-dialog.component.ts#ChildCategoryDialogComponent.create` — as: component
- binds: `service:juicecommerce:categories#createCategory` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred
